  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Perception</strong> 是一款專為豐富遊戲視覺體驗而設計的 Minecraft 模組，透過沉浸式的視覺效果來提升遊戲氛圍。與其著重於高度專業的視覺特效，Perception 提供了精心打造的增強功能，以更全面的方式影響遊戲玩法。我們的目標是為您帶來對周遭世界的全新視角，讓每一次遭遇都感覺更加生動且具互動性。</p>\n<p>目前，<strong>Perception</strong> 包含兩項主要功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>跟隨投射物與實體的軌跡效果，為周遭世界增添動態的移動層次。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112793/description_8d66508d-637a-4342-bdf2-f5cc78dc59c5.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"451\"></li>\n<li>由巨大聲響、爆炸或快速移動觸發的方向性螢幕震動效果。這不僅能強化您的沉浸感，還能幫助您精準定位潛在威脅的來源，同時提升氛圍營造與環境感知能力。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8Ci05FS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>請注意，Perception 仍處於積極開發階段。其功能可能會（且很可能會）隨著時間不斷演進與擴充。如果您有任何關於新效果的構想或改善現有功能的建議，歡迎在我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a> 上分享。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7XhMeUr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/perception\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fperception\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fperception%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fperception%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRelics%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想嘗試我們的其他模組嗎？- 請前往 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 了解更多資訊！</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
